# Build context of apps/server/Dockerfile and apps/web/Dockerfile, both built from the repo root.
# The images install their own dependencies from bun.lock, so nothing from a laptop may leak in.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/next-env.d.ts
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
apps/mac

# Env reaches the containers from Seylo, never through the image.
**/.env
**/.env.*
